{"v":4,"catch":"在 Fluffy Cubed 中，玩家必須將盒子推到地圖上的正確位置才能升級。","desc":"Fluffy Cubed 是一款極簡主義的益智遊戲，其機制的靈感來自日本著名的推箱子類型。\n\n在這個遊戲中，你扮演一個立方體形狀的小貓，它必須將盒子移動到它們的位置。 但事情並沒有那麼簡單，你需要好好分析你的動作，確保箱子不會被卡住。\n\n界面簡單、可愛，你不必擔心只有一種方法可以解決它們，因為有多種方法可以完成關卡。\n\n特徵：\n- 120 個級別；\n- 極簡主義的環境；\n- 平靜和放鬆的配樂；\n- 可愛的氛圍；\n\n由 Naoka Games 開發","publisher":"QUByte Interactive","release":"2022-02-17","genres":["桌上遊戲","策略","訓練","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e7d89c93be7a9abf571f3e10f3cc07ed7451585481867739824edead8c8c68cf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/50f59a62b535492022bc16473834ac06ab4433a24e9182ae45af8aa8e0018e2f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/85a5f427c015bb6a04641747a27f2f3a428de8f2562f4adcc0b39a67a360036b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/342f672321e03ff9a2623f67d1d93e66fc9476d7ab34b4a7dbdb638aa60a1952.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/001f6ee8fda79fdf364be991f05025231863a5a1d44ccde4a096fa92d6b45772.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a8ff60f2faed9150ebdb7118049b6e9845d0cb4d038897a2808faefe13368f85.jpg"],"titleId":"01001f40168de000","dlc":[]}